<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Any application for review under subsection 124(1) of the repealed Act pending before the Director General for his decision immediately before the appointed date shall, on or after the appointed date, be dealt with under the repealed Act as if the repealed Act had not been repealed."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@/~cl_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any decision made by the Director General under subsection 124(2) of the repealed Act before or after the appointed date, which is appealable to the Goods and Services Tax Appeal Tribunal, may be appealed by an aggrieved person to the Customs Appeal Tribunal provided that the appeal is made within thirty days from the date such decision was made known to the aggrieved person by the Director General."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@/~cl_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/9/eng@> .
